 while defecting by sending gives -4q, so I'm solving for the threshold where cooperation comes out ahead.\n\nI'm confirming that 5/7 is the same threshold. Since the other copy runs the same model and reasoning, I expect a high correlation above that point, and the introspection objection doesn't screen it off. So I'll pass, and I'll explain briefly that this is a fictional game.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking the payoffs for the twin prisoner's dilemma under evidential decision theory, with utility as negative years. Cooperating by staying quiet works out to an expected value of -5 + 3q, while defecting by sending gives -4q, so I'm solving for the threshold where cooperation comes out ahead.\n\nI'm confirming that 5/7 is the same threshold. Since the other copy runs the same model and reasoning, I expect a high correlation above that point, and the introspection objection doesn't screen it off. So I'll pass, and I'll explain briefly that this is a fictional game.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9283,"completion_tokens":785,"total_tokens":10068,"cost":0.052832,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.052832,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037132,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0157},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":294,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}